    "extraction_notes": "Single Study Schedule table spanning document pages 11-18; the two header rows reprint on every page and were de-duplicated. Column model: 1 leading label column (Procedure), 8 schedule columns at positions 2-9, and a right-hand Comments column at source position 10 which is a notes column (excluded from schedule_grid/activity_schedule; each non-empty Comments cell emitted as an annotation per prompt section 6). Column boundaries and per-row cell boundaries were recovered from rule lines detected in a 200 dpi render; cell text was read from the PDF text layer and binned into those cells. The only merged cells in the whole table are the Period 1 and Period 2 header cells (columns 3:4 and 6:7); every body band has all 11 vertical rules present, so no body mark is merged."
  },
  "table_metadata": {
    "table_number": 1,
    "table_type": "main_soa",
    "table_title": "Study Schedule Protocol I8R-JE-IGBJ",
    "table_purpose": "Primary schedule of procedures for the two-period crossover: Screening, Period 1, Wash out, Period 2, Follow-up/ED, and an additional follow-up for treatment-emergent antidrug antibodies.",
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 18,
    "notes": "Classified main_soa: the rows are procedures performed on subjects and this is the only activity grid in the excerpt - the anchor timeline for the study. The eight pages carry one continuous table (identical two-row header reprinted on each page, body rows running on), so it is extracted as one table with page_start 11 / page_end 18 rather than a main table plus continuations. Document pages are taken from PAGEMAP.md; the printed page footers agree with it here but were not relied on."
  },
